\pard\plain \s3\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\cgrid 
Detailed Description\par
\pard\plain 
{
\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Defines constants for configurable properties for the library. \par
}{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Typically these properties are set via {\b Assimp::Importer::SetPropertyFloat}, {\b Assimp::Importer::SetPropertyInteger} or {\b Assimp::Importer::SetPropertyString}, depending on the data type of a property. All properties have a default value. See the doc for the mentioned methods for more details.\par
\par
\par
 The corresponding functions for use with the plain-c API are: {\b aiSetImportPropertyInteger}, {\b aiSetImportPropertyFloat}, {\b aiSetImportPropertyString} \par
}}
