When loading MD3 files, {\b Assimp} checks whether a file [md3_file_name]_[skin_name].skin is existing. These files are used by Quake III to be able to assign different skins (e.g. red and blue team) to models. 'default', 'red', 'blue' are typical skin names. Property type: String. Default value: "default". \par
