{
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Configures the {\b aiProcess_OptimizeGraph} step to preserve nodes matching a name in a given list. }}\par
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
This is a list of 1 to n strings, ' ' serves as delimiter character. Identifiers containing whitespaces must be enclosed in {\i single}  quotation marks. For example:{\f2  "keep-me and_me_to anotherNodeToBeKept \\'name with whitespace\\'"} . If a node matches on of these names, it will not be modified or removed by the postprocessing step.\par
 This option might be useful if you are using some magic node names to pass additional semantics through the content pipeline. This ensures they won't be optimized away, but a general optimization is still performed for nodes not contained in the list. Property type: String. Default value: n/a \par
{{\s5\sb90\sa30\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs16\cgrid 
Note\par}\pard\plain \s82\li720\widctlpar\ql\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {\s17 \sa60 \sb30
Linefeeds, tabs or carriage returns are treated as whitespace. Node names are case sensitive. \par
}}}}
